      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I've been using a similar config to reset my screen to minimum window size in  hopes of reducing overhead when in VR (though it might just be a placebo) and I've had the same thing happen when launching. It briefly will show this half  maximized, half desired window size initialization state before loading VRChat properly. It does still appear to respect the monitor selection parameter.\n\nLaunch parameters:\n\n`--enable-sdk-log-levels -monitor 2 -screen-width 320 -screen-height 240`",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
