  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I use the -screen-width  2560 -screen-height 1440 launch parameters to reset my window size upon launch of the game, it seems that these parameters are ignored in favor of the screen size setting which is available when playing on desktop mode (even while playing VR mode)",
